OL,3,GNEWSABird flu cases confirmed as
OL,4,Ahousing order begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third case of avian flu has been
OL,7,Fconfirmed in East Yorkshire and
OL,8,FLincolnshire as a national housing
OL,9,Forder comes into place.
OL,11,FBird flu was found at commercial
OL,12,Fpoultry premises near Market Rasen in
OL,13,FLincolnshire on Wednesday, and a case
OL,14,Fwas also confirmed near Pocklington in
OL,15,FEast Yorkshire on 7 November.
OL,17,FNationally, an order came into effect
OL,18,Fat 00:01 GMT directing all poultry
OL,19,Fholders with more than 50 birds to
OL,20,Fensure they are housed.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
