OL,3,GNEWSABird flu cases confirmed as
OL,4,Ahousing order begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FUK Chief Veterinary Officer Christine
OL,7,FMiddlemiss said bird keepers were being
OL,8,Fasked to "exercise robust biosecurity"
OL,9,Fand report any signs of the disease
OL,10,Fimmediately.
